    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85628" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πομπ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a solemn procession,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἵππος</span> a horse <i>of state,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				11.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.211
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίδια, ζεῦγος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1424a
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				395
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2311.65
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέμμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					18.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					56.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Aem.</u>
					33
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>stately, magnificent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Mar.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; of literary style, <i>impressive,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.96S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Is.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				8.3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					32.5
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
